  "description": "The perfect candidate for a live-in son-in-law had appeared. Seo Minhan, the youngest of the three sons of SJ Group. He came from a good family, had no responsibilities to shoulder, and didn’t seem clever enough to covet what was mine. In more ways than one, he was a man who fit perfectly into the picture I had in mind. As for his current occupation... well, perhaps a wealthy unemployed man? If I wanted to remain “Han Chaekyung of Seongho,” he was an excellent choice.    \n\n“Then, what would you think about marrying me?”   \n“Mar—”     \n“Marriage. You and me, Mr. Seo Minhan.” \n\nHe readily agreed, and until we left for our honeymoon, I thought everything was going exactly according to plan. \n\n“I’m a quick learner when it comes to anything physical... but I don’t know what comes next. Will you teach me, Chaekyung?”     \n“I’ve always wanted to do this. I want to kiss everywhere my eyes can reach.”    \n“I think if we do it one more time... I’ll be better at it.”\n\nI never knew this was my type. Was it a mistake to propose an arranged marriage to him that day?\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \nR19: [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=9534825), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/marryplan_19), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/arranged_marriage)  \nR15: [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=8937214), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/marryplan_15), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/arranged_marriage_15)",
